---
import Layout from "./Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="jwstn.dev — personnel file: JW"
  description="JW is a full-stack developer from Cologne, Germany — TanStack systems, Effect/Hono/Elysia experiments and recon imagery from the Japan 2026 camera trip, filed as an industrial HUD."
>
  <section class="cy-pagehead" aria-label="Personnel file — who JW is">
    <p class="cy-kicker cy-reveal">// personnel file 001 — clearance: public</p>
    <h1 class="cy-title cy-bootglitch cy-glitch">JW — full-stack developer</h1>
    <p class="cy-sub">
      Unit stationed in cologne, germany. Builds web systems with <em>TanStack</em> as the primary
      platform. Side experiments ongoing.
    </p>
  </section>

  <div class="cy-reveal" style="--d: 0.12s">
    <div class="cy-frame">
      <p class="cy-panel-head">field readout</p>
      <div class="cy-panel-body">
        <ul class="cy-readouts">
          <li class="cy-readout">
            <span class="cy-readout-key">operator</span>
            <span class="cy-readout-rule" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <span class="cy-readout-val">jw — full-stack developer</span>
          </li>
          <li class="cy-readout">
            <span class="cy-readout-key">base of operations</span>
            <span class="cy-readout-rule" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <span class="cy-readout-val">cologne, germany</span>
          </li>
          <li class="cy-readout">
            <span class="cy-readout-key">primary system</span>
            <span class="cy-readout-rule" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <span class="cy-readout-val"><em>tanstack</em></span>
          </li>
          <li class="cy-readout">
            <span class="cy-readout-key">test chamber</span>
            <span class="cy-readout-rule" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <span class="cy-readout-val">effect · hono · elysia</span>
          </li>
          <li class="cy-readout">
            <span class="cy-readout-key">fabrication lab</span>
            <span class="cy-readout-rule" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <span class="cy-readout-val">rust · gpui · terminal uis</span>
          </li>
          <li class="cy-readout">
            <span class="cy-readout-key">optical unit</span>
            <span class="cy-readout-rule" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <span class="cy-readout-val">camera acquired in japan — march 2026</span>
          </li>
          <li class="cy-readout">
            <span class="cy-readout-key">status</span>
            <span class="cy-readout-rule" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <span class="cy-readout-val"><i class="cy-dot" aria-hidden="true"></i> online</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <p class="cy-bio cy-reveal" style="--d: 0.2s">
    I build web applications with <a href="https://tanstack.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
      >TanStack</a
    > as my daily platform — it covers most of what a web app needs, including the more complex parts like
    server actions and middleware, so backend frameworks such as
    <a href="https://hono.dev/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Hono</a> or
    <a href="https://elysiajs.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Elysia</a> have stayed in the test
    chamber so far. The experiment that did get cleared for field use is
    <a href="https://effect.website/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Effect</a> — amazing fun so far,
    and a great opportunity to learn a new way of programming. After hours the lab runs Rust, GPUI, a terminal UI
    for Spotify, and a note app that refuses to stay decommissioned. In March 2026 I acquired a camera in Japan —
    the resulting imagery is archived under <a href="/gallery/">recon</a>.
  </p>

  <div class="cy-reveal" style="--d: 0.28s">
    <div class="cy-frame">
      <p class="cy-panel-head">site directory — indexed</p>
      <ul class="cy-dirs" aria-label="Site sections">
        <li>
          <a class="cy-dir-link" href="/projects/">
            <span class="cy-dir-idx">01</span>
            <span class="cy-dir-name">mission archive</span>
            <span class="cy-dir-desc">projects — 4 files</span>
            <span class="cy-dir-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
          </a>
        </li>
        <li>
          <a class="cy-dir-link" href="/blog/">
            <span class="cy-dir-idx">02</span>
            <span class="cy-dir-name">mission log</span>
            <span class="cy-dir-desc">blog — 0 entries logged</span>
            <span class="cy-dir-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
          </a>
        </li>
        <li>
          <a class="cy-dir-link" href="/gallery/">
            <span class="cy-dir-idx">03</span>
            <span class="cy-dir-name">recon imagery</span>
            <span class="cy-dir-desc">gallery — 3 albums</span>
            <span class="cy-dir-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
          </a>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
